window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>To save her world, she must sacrifice everything she holds dear.</p> <p>Despite descending from a long line of powerful sorcerers, Vi Solaris lacked all magic. That is, until the day she manifested a powerful sorcery unlike any other.</p> <p>Now, a sorcerer from a distant land tells her she must leave her home to claim her true power as champion of the goddess. That the mysterious plague ripping through her empire is the first warning an ancient evil threatens to rise anew. And that she is the only one who can put a stop to it.</p> <p>Making matters worse, her empire falters under political turmoil, and her disappearance as the crown princess might just be what causes it to buckle. Assassins anointed by the evil she seeks to thwart hunt her relentlessly. And, despite herself, she's falling for that charming sorcerer with pointed ears and haunted eyes as he trains her in secret.</p> <p>Vi embarks on a perilous journey across land and sea that will unveil shocking truths about her dying world, explore the mysteries of primordial magic, and have her fighting for the one thing that remains when all else is lost: love. Love for her home, her family, her duty, and for the man who will stay at her side until the world's end.</p> <p>Vortex Chronicles is perfect for young-adult epic-fantasy fans who love sweeping adventures, coming-of-age stories, sword and sorcery, thrilling magic, slow-burn romance that doesn't overwhelm the main plot, and hope prevailing—all tied up with a happily ever after. Fans of Victoria Aveyard, Leigh Bardugo, and Alexandra Bracken are sure to be delighted by Vortex Chronicles.</p> <p>This complete series omnibus edition contains all five books in Vortex Chronicles by<i> USA Today</i> best-selling author Elise Kova:</p> <ol> <li><i>Vortex Visions</i></li> <li><i>Chosen Champion</i></li> <li><i>Failed Future</i></li> <li><i>Sovereign Sacrifice</i></li> <li><i>Crystal Caged</i></li> </ol>"; 
